WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:06.210
When I tried it, I felt better than I ever had so... I just kept on doing it

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:16.320
Why? 
I don't know. I thought we were closer than most fathers and sons. This isn't us.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.889
This is not who we are- 
...Both of you, stop

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:25.369
There are moments that I look at him and I wonder who he is

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:30.540
How's that boy David? I'm not giving up now. Never

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:37.900
You always gotta be controlling everything- 
It doesn't make any sense. 
You're controlling me right now!

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:43.300
Let us help you- 
I don't want your help don't you understand that?

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.240
I had such grand plans

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:54.160
You'd graduate from college, do something amazing. And now I just want you to not die

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:58.100
Who are you Nick? 
This is me, Dad. Here. This is who I am

00:01:00.379 --> 00:01:07.989
If you could take all the words in the language it's still indescribable how much I love you. I love you more than everything

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:12.310
I'm really sorry, Dad

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.340
It's hard as hell to get sober

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.200
But I love my family

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:30.220
I want them to be proud of me

00:01:37.409 --> 00:01:42.089
I understand how scared you are. It'll pass though. It always does

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:51.600
Nic, what you have is extraordinary

00:01:54.320 --> 00:01:58.700
And you're gonna get it back. You're gonna find it again

